<br/>

<p><strong>Recommended Actions:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Navigate to <strong>Setup → Apex Jobs</strong></li>
    <li>Review batch logs and SOQL selectivity</li>
    <li>Abort and reschedule the batch if required</li>
</ul>

<p>
This notification is generated automatically based on
<strong>Custom Metadata batch thresholds</strong>.
</p>

